# Terror of the Peaks: "Whenever another creature you control enters, this creature deals damage equal to that creature's
# power to any target" (CR 603.6a, 120.3). Terror itself entering (put onto the battlefield by Show and Tell) does not
# trigger it: Bot1 is asked for no target. Bot2's Ornithopter entering on turn 2 is not Bot1's: no target either. On turn 3
# Bot1's Ornithopter triggers it, aimed at Bot2, and deals no damage, its power being 0 (CR 120.8); Bot1's Embereth
# Shieldbreaker triggers it and Terror deals 2 damage to Bot2.

